sentences.text:
The petitioner shall not enter the Taluk where the victim and the witnesses are residing till the conclusion of the trial in Crime No.195/2024, other than for the purpose of reporting before the Investigating Officer;
v. In case of violation of any of the conditions mentioned above, the jurisdictional court shall be empowered to consider the application for cancellation of bail, if any filed, and pass orders on the same, in accordance with law.
vi.

